  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### Is it possible to set up a general chart of accounts?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 17 Nov, 2021 at  4:17 PM\n\n\t\tYou can update the Master Chart of Accounts, which will be applicable to all your clients. To update the Nominal Codes.\n\nNavigation: Bookkeeping > General Settings > Chart of Accounts\n\nClick here to watch a video on how to update the Master Chart of Accounts\n\nClick here to watch how to make nominal codes active / inactive\n\nSettings>>general settings\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Is it possible to set up a general chart of accounts?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 17 Nov, 2021 at  4:17 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You can update the Master Chart of Accounts, which will be applicable to all your clients. To update the Nominal Codes.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Navigation: </strong>Bookkeeping &gt; General Settings &gt; Chart of Accounts</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/ab34147d3c7a4ab4b4a56e0c5832f46a\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch a video on how to update the Master Chart of Accounts</span></strong></a><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/86859e188a9b4352b4ffb3e5ba36a979\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/86859e188a9b4352b4ffb3e5ba36a979\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to make nominal codes active / inactive</span></strong></a></p